# %% [markdown]
# ## Summary
#
# - **Representational harm**: Biased portrayal (stereotypes, erasure) in generated text
# - **Allocational harm**: Biased material outcomes (resume scoring, recommendations)
# - **Three metric categories**: Embedding-based (WEAT), Probability-based (likelihood), Generated-text-based (task performance)
# - **Intersectionality**: Bias that emerges at the intersection of multiple identity axes (e.g., Black women)
# - **Mechanistic approaches**: Gender neurons, SAE features, attention-head manipulation for zero-shot debiasing
# - **Meta-critique**: The field neglects many identity axes beyond binary gender
